WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.647
On this slide, we are focusing on boolean conversion previews decision logic.

00:00:04.647 --> 00:00:09.427
Start with the meaning of the idea before worrying about the exact syntax.

00:00:09.427 --> 00:00:15.337
Ask what information is going in, what Python is doing with it, and what result should come out.

00:00:15.337 --> 00:00:18.512
Connect the concept to a small analytics task.

00:00:18.512 --> 00:00:23.587
Imagine the value came from a sales file, survey, or operational system.

00:00:23.587 --> 00:00:31.032
Ask whether Python is interpreting it correctly and whether another person could understand the calculation

00:00:31.032 --> 00:00:32.732
from the names and output.

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:36.962
Before moving on, explain the main idea in one sentence without reading the slide.

00:00:36.962 --> 00:00:42.379
That quick explanation is a useful check that the concept is becoming reusable knowledge.
